			"value": "title: serverExternalPackages\ndescription: Opt-out specific dependencies from the Server Components bundling and use native Node.js `require`."
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"children": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "Dependencies used inside "
				},
				{
					"type": "link",
